Package: com.doro.springboard.ball
Name: DoroSB Ball
Version: 1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: SpringBoard floating ball - writes cloud script to Delta Force container, auto-deletes after 2s, closes ball and quits toolbox. Runs as SpringBoard (cross-app, visible on home screen).
